OL,3,GNEWSARobinson says confidence in
OL,4,AParades Commission remains low
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,7,Fleader Gavin Robinson has said
OL,8,Fconfidence in the Parades Commission
OL,9,Fremains low despite it submitting a
OL,10,Fplan aimed at restoring public
OL,11,Fconfidence.
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,14,FBryant said on Friday that he had
OL,15,Freceived a letter from the commission
OL,16,Foutlining how it intends to restore
OL,17,Fconfidence.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
