OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARobinson says confidence in
OL,4,AParades Commission remains low
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows a High Court decision to
OL,7,Fquash restrictions on this year's
OL,8,FOrange Order parade along the Garvaghy
OL,9,FRoad in Portadown after the commission
OL,10,Fconceded a procedural error.
OL,12,FSpeaking to BBC News NI on Saturday,
OL,13,FRobinson said Sir Chris would have to
OL,14,Fconsider the commission's response
OL,15,F"properly" and "seriously".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
